2026 13:22:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>……阳光在外，阳光在内……</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b13ea231</link><description>&lt;p&gt;……阳光在外，阳光在内……&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up of a sunflower indoors, illuminated by the sun outside, which is already quite low in the sky. The title refers to a Norwegian children’s song: 
Sol ute, sol inne.
Sol i hjertet,
Sol i sinnet,
Sol, bare sol.
(English)
Sun outside, sun inside,
Sun in the heart,
Sun in the mind,
Sun, only sun." height="3556" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6ad76b13ea231.jpg" width="2924"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:22:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>依兰依兰 — 参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76b0c7cf32</link><description>&lt;p&gt;依兰依兰 — 参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A ylang ylang branch with broad leaves and hanging yellow flowers with long narrow petals." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76b0c7cf32.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:22:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>香根草参考插图</title><link>https://some.pics/6ad76afadbe9a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;香根草——参考插图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dense living clump of vetiver grass growing in soil, with narrow upright blades and flowering stalks." height="1254" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ad76afadbe9a.png" width="1254"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:22:06 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>